Portfolio optimization data and generated models in this directory are taken
from QOBLIB (Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library), problem 06.

Source repository: https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB
Problem page: https://zib-aopt.github.io/QOBLIB/problem/06/
Instance page: https://zib-aopt.github.io/QOBLIB/instance.html?problem=06&name=a010_t10_s00_b004

The registered instance a010_t10_s00_b004_l1e-4 keeps one published lambda,
tag 1e-4 (lambda 0.0001). That folder contains both the constrained LP and the
penalty QUBO.

